msgctxt "80"
msgid "I told you, I don't have that book no more. I sold it to Ebisu Pawn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"(Someone else might buy it if I don't hurry... I need to get to Ebisu Pawn "
"in Nakamichi Alley.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Hey, are you Kamekichi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"What the hell do you want? Can't you see I'm on a losing streak? I just "
"wanna be left alone..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"You took a book from Master Komaki's dojo, didn't you? I'm here to get it "
"back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "What book? Oh, you mean that dirty old thing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"I sold it to Ebisu Pawn to get me some gambling money. They didn't give me "
"much for it, though... and the money's long gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "You sold it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "(I'd better get over there before someone else buys it.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "(I need to go to Ebisu Pawn in Nakamichi Alley.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1700"
msgid "Kamekichi"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1704"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""
